WEBVTT

01:31.168 --> 01:33.792
[Episode 16]

02:24.992 --> 02:27.432
It symbolizes Feng Shan Jian.

02:28.351 --> 02:29.671
It means,

02:29.671 --> 02:30.791
the wild goose gradually approaches the land,

02:31.791 --> 02:32.992
the husband leaves and does not return,

02:33.911 --> 02:35.272
and the wife is infertile.

02:36.272 --> 02:37.568
It's a sign of misfortune.

02:37.568 --> 02:40.471
Infertility? Master,
could you say a bit more?

02:40.471 --> 02:43.432
My husband and I are desperate for a child.

02:43.432 --> 02:46.432
We've seen many famous physicians
for my pregnancy,

02:46.432 --> 02:47.911
but we have never
been able to fulfill our wish.

02:47.911 --> 02:50.071
Madam, no need to worry too much.

02:50.832 --> 02:54.791
Judging by the divinatory symbol,
Lord Gu is destined to have a son.

02:54.791 --> 02:55.791
However,

02:56.471 --> 02:59.312
unfortunately, it's difficult to have one.

03:00.191 --> 03:02.951
But it is not entirely hopeless.

03:02.951 --> 03:06.272
Madam, if you do good deeds
to accumulate blessings,

03:06.272 --> 03:09.112
perhaps you'll get your wish.

03:09.112 --> 03:10.624
Wonderful!

03:10.624 --> 03:13.191
My dear, we will definitely have a child.

03:18.992 --> 03:21.832
Master, I vow that from this day forward,

03:21.832 --> 03:23.542
on the first and fifteenth day
of every lunar month,

03:23.542 --> 03:26.231
I will come here, fast for three days,

03:26.231 --> 03:29.471
and enshrine a Buddhist niche,
worshiping the Buddha with utmost sincerity.

03:29.471 --> 03:32.511
May Heaven grant our Gu family a son

03:32.511 --> 03:33.712
to carry on the family line.

03:33.712 --> 03:36.911
With your sincerity,
you'll surely receive the Buddha's blessing.

03:38.272 --> 03:40.071
Amitabha.

03:48.032 --> 03:49.511
<i>Merciful Buddha,</i>

03:49.511 --> 03:51.281
<i>if I could have a son,</i>

03:51.281 --> 03:54.231
<i>I would do anything
to repay the Buddha's kindness.</i>

03:57.872 --> 03:59.231
Zhi Shu left in such a hurry.

03:59.872 --> 04:01.911
Most of all, he was so secretive.

04:01.911 --> 04:03.712
I have no idea where he was really going

04:03.712 --> 04:04.992
or if it was dangerous.

04:04.992 --> 04:06.312
Don't worry, Zhi Li.

04:06.312 --> 04:07.392
When it comes to food,
clothing, and daily needs,

04:07.392 --> 04:10.392
he never treats himself poorly.

04:10.392 --> 04:13.512
Besides, he masters martial arts,
so he will be safe.

04:14.832 --> 04:18.032
In the past, the three of us
always came together to pray for our parents.

04:18.032 --> 04:19.471
We always found him too noisy.

04:20.272 --> 04:23.431
This time,
it actually feels a bit quiet without him.

04:23.431 --> 04:24.871
I wonder when he will return.

04:26.111 --> 04:28.632
Zhi Shu always feels
he is the least valued at home.

04:29.671 --> 04:32.712
But after he's been away for only a few days,
we all miss him terribly.

04:33.952 --> 04:34.952
Come.

04:35.832 --> 04:38.551
Greetings, Mr. Gu, Mrs. Gu.

04:38.551 --> 04:41.231
Le Yan, I didn't see you
in the painting class yesterday.

04:41.952 --> 04:43.032
What happened to you?

04:43.791 --> 04:47.192
I just caught a cold and felt unwell,
so I couldn't make it.

04:47.192 --> 04:49.311
- Did you see a physician?
- Uncle Gu.

04:49.952 --> 04:51.111
Aunt.

04:51.111 --> 04:53.551
Did you come here to pray today?

04:53.551 --> 04:55.911
My husband and I came here

04:55.911 --> 04:59.111
to pray for the continuation
of the Gu family's bloodline.

04:59.911 --> 05:02.991
May your wish come true then.

05:03.752 --> 05:04.752
- Zhi Li!
- Le Yan.

05:06.111 --> 05:08.272
- Hurry up!
- Coming.

05:08.272 --> 05:09.272
Did it hurt?

05:10.471 --> 05:11.471
It's fine.

05:15.111 --> 05:17.911
Captain Di is so considerate.

05:17.911 --> 05:20.032
My dear, look at them.

05:20.032 --> 05:22.431
What a young, perfect match.

05:22.431 --> 05:24.272
You can't tell at all
that they are real siblings.

05:24.272 --> 05:25.592
We were never real siblings
in the first place.

05:26.192 --> 05:28.431
Zhi Li, it's getting late.

05:28.431 --> 05:29.791
It's time to pray for our parents.

05:31.272 --> 05:33.512
Mr. Gu, Mrs. Gu, we shall take our leave now.

05:44.712 --> 05:47.231
You behaved improperly just now.

05:47.231 --> 05:48.911
A kid just slightly bumped into her.

05:48.911 --> 05:50.032
Look how worried you were.

05:52.111 --> 05:55.431
Look at them,
they're young and grew up together.

05:55.431 --> 05:57.791
But you're not as young as them.

05:57.791 --> 05:59.272
You're too old for playing the hero,

05:59.272 --> 06:00.471
and you'll hurt yourself instead.

06:02.471 --> 06:05.111
We're at a sacred temple. Mind your words.

06:05.791 --> 06:07.471
That's exactly

06:08.072 --> 06:10.991
why you should be even clearer
about thoughts you shouldn't have.

06:12.911 --> 06:13.911
Just now,

06:14.952 --> 06:16.952
you looked so worried.

06:18.111 --> 06:21.351
- It reminded me of how you treated me--
- Absurd!

06:22.311 --> 06:23.832
Don't talk nonsense here!

07:19.791 --> 07:21.551
Your Majesty,
have you been waiting for a while?

07:22.871 --> 07:23.871
I just arrived as well.

07:39.712 --> 07:41.431
The tea has boiled three times,
and it's the perfect moment to drink.

07:42.231 --> 07:45.231
Sit down and have some hot tea
to warm yourself up.

08:11.392 --> 08:14.512
Miss Meng, you're usually calm and impartial.

08:14.512 --> 08:15.991
Why are you so nervous now?

08:17.272 --> 08:19.991
The noodles are getting cold.
Your Majesty, please try them quickly.

08:32.671 --> 08:36.071
The imperial kitchen
can make various delicacies,

08:37.071 --> 08:39.472
but none is as comforting
as these comforting mutton noodles.

08:43.032 --> 08:44.911
Your Majesty has tried different delicacies.

08:44.911 --> 08:48.472
Before you tried mutton noodles,
what was your favorite food?

08:50.431 --> 08:53.272
Are you trying to know more about me?

08:54.352 --> 08:56.551
Your Majesty, you already know my past,

08:57.472 --> 09:00.152
but I still know very little about you.

09:01.032 --> 09:02.071
It should be fair.

09:09.112 --> 09:10.191
I still remember

09:10.911 --> 09:13.831
when I was little,
layer cake was my favorite food,

09:15.951 --> 09:17.551
the layer cake made by my mother.

09:18.791 --> 09:21.831
After she passed away, I missed her so much.

09:21.831 --> 09:25.232
I ate 12 boxes of layer cakes
she left in her place.

09:25.232 --> 09:26.551
In the end, I vomited.

09:26.551 --> 09:30.311
After that,
I never had any great desire for food again.

09:31.032 --> 09:32.671
There is no preferred food for me.

09:32.671 --> 09:34.951
People yearn for the food

09:35.951 --> 09:38.591
because of its taste
and what it reminds us of.

09:40.311 --> 09:44.032
Just like when I see apricot skin cakes,
I think of Xiang.

09:48.671 --> 09:51.512
Because of you,
I remember the taste of mutton noodles.

09:52.671 --> 09:55.791
Then for now, you remember my chestnuts.

10:10.711 --> 10:11.711
It's snowing.

10:26.711 --> 10:28.152
I rarely saw snow in Shazhou.

10:29.311 --> 10:32.272
I heard from Fu Zhi that making a wish
on the first snow works the best.

10:33.551 --> 10:35.632
It's a pity we missed the first snow.

10:38.551 --> 10:40.032
Why wait for snow to make a wish?

10:41.472 --> 10:43.152
I can fulfill your wishes.

10:46.352 --> 10:49.352
I hope to capture Ling Yun Fei

10:49.352 --> 10:50.951
and eradicate the Huxiao Gang.

10:50.951 --> 10:53.551
I also hope the Ning Empire
will be peaceful and prosperous.

10:59.551 --> 11:00.632
Your Majesty, do you have a wish?

11:06.591 --> 11:09.591
No, this is highly improper!

11:11.392 --> 11:12.591
Then why are you so loud?

11:12.591 --> 11:13.951
You want to tell the entire court?

11:16.071 --> 11:19.671
How can His Majesty
meet Miss Meng here in secret?

11:19.671 --> 11:21.591
A ruler and a subject can't be
in a relationship,

11:21.591 --> 11:23.352
which will cause death by a thousand cuts.

11:23.352 --> 11:24.431
Watch your words.

11:25.032 --> 11:27.232
His Majesty is discussing important matters
with Miss Meng.

11:27.232 --> 11:28.992
No, look!

11:28.992 --> 11:31.191
Is this how they discuss important matters?

11:31.191 --> 11:32.872
Dining and walking in the snow?

11:32.872 --> 11:34.431
How improper!

11:34.431 --> 11:35.632
No, I must go take a look.

11:38.352 --> 11:40.191
I wish to fulfill your wishes.

11:42.112 --> 11:44.431
I hope that next year,

11:45.431 --> 11:46.791
I will still have old friends by my side.

11:53.472 --> 11:55.472
Your Majesty, you have no family, like me.

11:56.911 --> 11:58.872
Though you receive best wishes
from your people,

11:58.872 --> 12:02.112
you always celebrate New Year's Eve alone.

12:03.872 --> 12:05.152
I will make another wish.

12:06.431 --> 12:09.032
I hope Your Majesty will always have someone

12:10.352 --> 12:12.752
celebrate festivals with you.

12:20.032 --> 12:21.232
When spring comes,

12:21.911 --> 12:24.112
shall we release floating lanterns together?

12:24.112 --> 12:25.112
It's a promise.

12:36.032 --> 12:37.032
Absurd!

12:39.032 --> 12:41.472
They actually met in private
in the imperial garden.

12:41.472 --> 12:43.032
Do they have any regard for court discipline?

12:43.032 --> 12:46.272
During the Huiyuan case,
I already felt that she would be a scourge.

12:46.272 --> 12:48.112
Now it caused quite a stir in the whole city.

12:48.791 --> 12:50.632
Haven't you heard?

12:50.632 --> 12:51.992
Didn't you remind His Majesty?

12:52.992 --> 12:54.752
Miss Meng has a pitiful background.

12:54.752 --> 12:56.951
For the sake of their old friendship,

12:56.951 --> 12:58.872
His Majesty looks after her a bit more.

12:58.872 --> 13:01.472
The word on the street
should not be taken as truth.

13:01.472 --> 13:03.136
Now His Majesty and Meng Ting Hui

13:03.136 --> 13:05.551
have become the common gossip for the people,

13:05.551 --> 13:07.632
which damages the prestige of the ruler.

13:07.632 --> 13:09.512
But every day,

13:09.512 --> 13:12.752
His Majesty looks at the plaque
of ancestral precepts presented by you.

13:12.752 --> 13:15.431
Probably, His Majesty knows what he is doing.

13:15.431 --> 13:18.671
Since His Majesty ascended the throne,
he has never married any woman,

13:18.671 --> 13:20.272
let alone have a child.

13:20.272 --> 13:22.392
But the nation needs an heir.

13:22.392 --> 13:24.512
I am also anxious about this.

13:24.512 --> 13:27.352
But last time when ladies performed dances,
His Majesty was displeased.

13:27.352 --> 13:29.152
Instead, he was quite angry.

13:29.152 --> 13:32.071
It frightened me so much
that I couldn't sleep for several nights.

13:35.392 --> 13:37.591
If His Majesty had an heir,

13:37.591 --> 13:40.152
he would naturally become more mature.

13:41.392 --> 13:43.551
So, what do you plan to do about this?

13:54.951 --> 13:56.032
My lord.

13:57.032 --> 14:00.911
There is a lot of gossip
about His Majesty and Meng Ting Hui.

14:01.752 --> 14:05.152
I've met Meng Ting Hui
at banquets a few times.

14:05.152 --> 14:07.431
She appears graceful,

14:08.191 --> 14:11.992
completely different from what others said.

14:11.992 --> 14:14.951
If His Majesty truly has feelings for her,

14:14.951 --> 14:16.472
it won't be surprising at all.

14:18.591 --> 14:22.431
Watch your words. A romance
between the ruler and his subject is a taboo.

14:23.232 --> 14:26.512
It's time
to send Wen Ruo Mei into the palace.

14:27.711 --> 14:30.831
That will make Meng Ting Hui
give up hope completely.

14:31.911 --> 14:35.191
Wen Ruo Mei is dull and short-sighted.

14:35.191 --> 14:37.191
How can she be the empress of the nation?

14:37.831 --> 14:39.632
Such a shallow view.

14:39.632 --> 14:42.791
At present, severing the bond
between His Majesty and Meng Ting Hui

14:42.791 --> 14:44.272
must be the priority.

14:45.191 --> 14:48.831
You are so devoted to state affairs

14:48.831 --> 14:52.352
and have no time
to think about our son's marriage.

14:52.352 --> 14:54.311
You must at least

14:54.311 --> 14:57.551
find him a suitable girl.

14:59.992 --> 15:03.032
If you and our son have someone in mind,

15:03.032 --> 15:04.591
just let me know.

15:04.591 --> 15:08.711
Who in the court would dare reject me?

15:08.711 --> 15:10.591
Father!

15:11.431 --> 15:13.632
Quickly find me the best matchmaker
in the capital.

15:13.632 --> 15:16.112
I've met the right woman for me.

15:17.992 --> 15:19.831
You've truly grown up,

15:19.831 --> 15:22.272
knowing to plan for your own future.

15:22.272 --> 15:23.272
Try this.

15:24.032 --> 15:25.032
Tell us.

15:26.071 --> 15:29.791
The girl I like is not ordinary.

15:29.791 --> 15:33.032
She is like a fairy from the mortal world,

15:33.032 --> 15:35.071
the Moon Goddess Chang'e from the heavens.

15:35.071 --> 15:37.831
She is a peerless beauty in the world.

15:37.831 --> 15:39.232
I'm crazy about her.

15:40.191 --> 15:42.311
Our son has a keen eye.

15:42.311 --> 15:44.431
Just tell us who she is.

15:46.632 --> 15:50.152
The first female Triple-First Zhuangyuan
in the Ning Empire.

15:51.472 --> 15:52.472
Who is she?

15:53.272 --> 15:55.311
Meng Ting Hui.

15:57.191 --> 15:59.472
Unless I am dead, you can't marry her.

16:00.352 --> 16:01.591
I have already set my mind on her.

16:01.591 --> 16:02.711
I will marry no one but her.

16:04.632 --> 16:05.632
- How dare you!
- Put that down!

16:09.671 --> 16:13.791
My lord, you rarely care about him.

16:13.791 --> 16:16.152
That's why he never wanted
to marry at this age.

16:18.232 --> 16:19.752
So,

16:19.752 --> 16:22.191
don't you feel guilty about Ze and me?

16:23.711 --> 16:25.152
Don't be angry yet.

16:25.152 --> 16:28.431
People say Meng Ting Hui is a heroine.

16:28.431 --> 16:30.112
Even His Majesty likes her.

16:30.112 --> 16:31.711
I went to see her out of admiration.

16:31.711 --> 16:32.951
Fortunately, I did so.

16:32.951 --> 16:36.431
Miss Meng is indeed the best woman.

16:36.431 --> 16:38.232
Upon seeing her,

16:38.232 --> 16:39.951
I knew she is the one I must marry.

16:40.992 --> 16:42.311
You...

16:42.311 --> 16:43.831
My lord.

16:43.831 --> 16:47.472
Have you ever seen our son
falling for any girl before?

16:48.872 --> 16:51.872
You want to sever the bond
between His Majesty and Meng Ting Hui, right?

16:53.191 --> 16:55.360
Why not let our son

16:55.360 --> 16:58.151
marry Meng Ting Hui? Then--

16:58.151 --> 17:00.432
Then I'll have her help Father
review memorials every day.

17:00.432 --> 17:03.391
I guarantee she'll do better
than any scholars of Hanlin Academy.

17:03.391 --> 17:05.512
- Right!
- Shut up! Nonsense!

17:06.952 --> 17:09.111
Our family has held official posts
for generations.

17:09.111 --> 17:11.752
How can we allow a common orphan girl
to stain our family's reputation?

17:12.952 --> 17:14.071
I...

17:14.071 --> 17:15.272
I don't care!

17:15.272 --> 17:16.672
I have already set my mind on her.

17:16.672 --> 17:19.952
If I can't marry her, I'll go die!

17:19.952 --> 17:21.512
Go die then!

17:21.512 --> 17:24.232
What are you talking about?

17:28.752 --> 17:30.672
Please, my lord.

17:30.672 --> 17:32.712
Our son is truly in love.

17:32.712 --> 17:34.311
If anything happens to him,

17:34.311 --> 17:37.272
I'll hang myself too!
I'll kill myself in front of you!

17:37.272 --> 17:38.551
I won't live either!

17:38.551 --> 17:41.472
We'll both die together!

17:44.591 --> 17:45.791
Shut up!

17:49.752 --> 17:51.912
Get out! All of you, get out!

17:51.912 --> 17:53.351
Fine, we'll get out!

17:57.432 --> 17:59.032
A doting mother spoils her child.

18:03.071 --> 18:05.272
Fu Zhi, where are you going?

18:05.272 --> 18:06.952
Meng, I was just looking for you.

18:06.952 --> 18:08.472
I received a letter saying
my father has fallen ill.

18:08.472 --> 18:09.591
He has been unconscious.

18:09.591 --> 18:10.791
I must rush back to see him.

18:10.791 --> 18:12.032
What's wrong with him?

18:12.032 --> 18:14.591
It's not certain yet.
Perhaps an old illness relapsed.

18:14.591 --> 18:16.631
He is old and has chronic conditions.

18:16.631 --> 18:17.672
I'll go back to check on him.

18:17.672 --> 18:19.311
Ms. Yan, it's getting late.

18:19.311 --> 18:20.871
Time to go.

18:20.871 --> 18:21.952
Meng.

18:21.952 --> 18:24.591
Ling Yun Fei will never just wait for death.

18:24.591 --> 18:26.831
You must be extremely careful
when I'm not around you.

18:26.831 --> 18:29.351
Don't worry. I will be very cautious.

18:29.351 --> 18:31.032
Go back and take good care of your father.

18:31.032 --> 18:32.311
Alright, I'm off.

18:35.351 --> 18:36.351
Take care on the way.

18:47.351 --> 18:48.351
My lady.

18:48.351 --> 18:51.232
The madam had the cook
make Dong'e donkey-hide gelatin soup for you.

18:51.232 --> 18:53.472
Okay, I'll drink it after I finish painting.

18:59.351 --> 19:00.351
And this.

19:01.111 --> 19:03.391
Lord Gu sent a painting.

19:03.391 --> 19:05.591
He said it must be delivered
to you personally.

19:07.032 --> 19:08.032
Leave it there.

19:26.032 --> 19:27.791
Trimming bamboo makes it straight,

19:28.512 --> 19:29.952
and pruning branches makes them flourish.

19:34.912 --> 19:37.591
<i>I know you have had doubts recently</i>

19:37.591 --> 19:39.351
<i>and have become somewhat distant from me.</i>

19:39.351 --> 19:42.512
<i>The court affairs are not
as simple as you see them.</i>

19:43.272 --> 19:45.071
<i>Although the Censorate
serves as the eyes and ears of the court,</i>

19:45.672 --> 19:47.111
<i>it has recently gotten off track.</i>

19:47.831 --> 19:50.512
<i>If not regulated properly,
it might cause a great disaster.</i>

19:51.871 --> 19:53.512
<i>Everything I say and do in the court</i>

19:53.512 --> 19:54.512
<i>is for the nation,</i>

19:54.512 --> 19:56.111
<i>the people, and the greater good.</i>

19:56.831 --> 19:57.992
<i>I hope you can understand.</i>

19:59.712 --> 20:01.032
<i>Stay on track,</i>

20:01.712 --> 20:03.871
<i>in case of being misled by appearances.</i>

20:05.952 --> 20:07.351
<i>Mr. Gu is telling me</i>

20:08.311 --> 20:11.912
<i>that everything he does is
to restrain improper conduct</i>

20:12.871 --> 20:15.912
<i>and help the Censorate develop
in a more orderly way.</i>

20:15.912 --> 20:17.600
[Read by Le Yan, from Gu Qin]

20:22.551 --> 20:24.831
Your Majesty, you're in a good mood tonight.

20:24.831 --> 20:26.512
I'm happy for you.

20:27.192 --> 20:29.111
Your Majesty, look at these carp.

20:29.111 --> 20:30.871
They compete for food, full of vitality.

20:30.871 --> 20:33.952
This symbolizes peace
and prosperity in the Ning Empire.

20:34.591 --> 20:35.591
Your Majesty.

20:36.591 --> 20:39.111
Your Majesty.

20:39.111 --> 20:40.992
An urgent secret letter from Mr. Shen.

20:40.992 --> 20:42.592
[Secret Letter]

20:44.151 --> 20:45.512
<i>I've been secretly investigating.</i>

20:45.512 --> 20:47.111
<i>At the border between Qingzhou and Beijian,</i>

20:47.111 --> 20:48.472
<i>I discovered a private mine.</i>

20:48.472 --> 20:49.712
<i>There are traces of weapon forging in it.</i>

20:50.512 --> 20:52.151
<i>This place is the former heartland
of Zhongwan.</i>

20:52.151 --> 20:55.192
<i>What's worse, Beijian troops have been
frequently provoking us on the border.</i>

20:56.472 --> 20:59.192
Huang Bo,
quickly send someone to deliver this token

20:59.192 --> 21:01.591
to General Huo De Wei
at the Qingzhou military camp.

21:01.591 --> 21:03.472
Order him to send men
to rush to help Zhi Shu.

21:03.472 --> 21:05.432
Yes, Your Majesty.

21:05.432 --> 21:06.432
The clues of the armory case,

21:06.432 --> 21:08.952
going full circles, has actually led back
to the former land of Zhongwan.

21:08.952 --> 21:10.192
If Beijian gets involved...

21:10.992 --> 21:12.591
Things got more interesting.

21:16.064 --> 21:18.784
[Blood Moon Society]

21:21.992 --> 21:23.992
When Shen Zhi Shu secretly tracked us,

21:23.992 --> 21:25.351
you were actually completely unaware.

21:25.952 --> 21:27.952
If Master hadn't let me escort you,

21:28.591 --> 21:30.272
we would have been exposed.

21:30.272 --> 21:31.311
Master once said

21:32.351 --> 21:36.232
the Blood Moon Society
doesn't need useless people.

21:38.232 --> 21:40.871
Master, please give us another chance.

21:40.871 --> 21:41.871
Master, spare our lives!

21:42.791 --> 21:43.791
Master.

21:43.791 --> 21:46.591
Si Jian, Si Qi,
and I were all trained by you.

21:46.591 --> 21:47.912
We're utterly loyal to Zhongwan.

21:48.551 --> 21:50.831
If you eliminate them for one mistake,

21:50.831 --> 21:52.871
I fear it will be hard
to find such trustworthy people again.

21:53.512 --> 21:55.432
I hope you will give them a chance.

21:55.432 --> 21:57.432
I'm willing to be punished on their behalf.

22:00.871 --> 22:03.111
I'll forgive them this time.

22:04.032 --> 22:06.032
The great cause of restoring our nation
cannot afford any mistakes.

22:07.351 --> 22:10.591
If it happens again,
there will be no leniency.

22:11.432 --> 22:12.472
Thank you, Master.

22:15.520 --> 22:17.201
Thank you for your magnanimity, Master.

22:17.672 --> 22:19.591
We will keep your warning in mind

22:19.591 --> 22:21.192
and ensure the great cause proceeds smoothly.

22:21.192 --> 22:23.272
Since Ying Gua has become suspicious,

22:23.272 --> 22:24.831
the forging operation
will be temporarily halted.

22:25.512 --> 22:29.591
He has been relentlessly pursuing us
since he caught wind of us in Shazhou.

22:29.591 --> 22:30.912
He has delayed many of our plans.

22:30.912 --> 22:33.591
Master, I gained something useful.

22:33.591 --> 22:35.712
I hastened to have people
find the Fuqing herb.

22:35.712 --> 22:38.631
The poison pill plan you've been plotting
can now be implemented.

22:40.472 --> 22:43.192
Master, regarding the poison pill plan,

22:43.192 --> 22:45.032
I also have an important matter to report.

22:45.032 --> 22:47.631
Two days ago, a guest came to Huiyin House.

22:47.631 --> 22:49.311
When he first arrived, he looked listless.

22:49.311 --> 22:51.111
But after taking a pill,

22:51.111 --> 22:53.551
he was instantly full of energy and relaxed.

22:53.551 --> 22:54.992
I grew suspicious

22:54.992 --> 22:56.391
and then hypnotized that guest.

22:56.391 --> 22:58.311
We learned
that although slightly weaker in potency,

22:58.311 --> 23:01.672
the pill has a strikingly similar effect
to the poison pill you plan to make.

23:14.151 --> 23:17.952
And this pill is only circulated secretly
among wealthy merchants.

23:17.952 --> 23:19.232
I have already found out

23:19.232 --> 23:21.871
that this merchant
is about to make a deal again.

23:21.871 --> 23:23.432
The dealer is called Lv Da.

23:24.111 --> 23:27.391
I didn't expect
the Huxiao Gang would also dabble in this.

23:27.992 --> 23:29.672
Since they have seen some initial success,

23:30.311 --> 23:33.311
we will take advantage of the situation.

23:34.111 --> 23:35.591
Although Ying Gua is tough,

23:35.591 --> 23:38.032
the Ning Empire is not monolithic.

23:38.032 --> 23:39.912
When the time is right,

23:39.912 --> 23:43.551
Zhongwan will see the light of day again.

23:44.432 --> 23:46.111
Black Bird eternal!

23:46.111 --> 23:47.672
Blood Moon forever!

23:47.672 --> 23:49.071
Black Bird eternal!

23:49.071 --> 23:50.791
Blood Moon forever!

23:56.272 --> 23:57.272
Master Lv.

24:13.631 --> 24:14.631
Master Lv.

24:15.391 --> 24:16.391
Please have mercy.

24:16.391 --> 24:17.791
Send a word to the gang leader.

24:17.791 --> 24:19.432
The pleasure from this stuff

24:19.432 --> 24:20.952
doesn't even last half a quarter of an hour.

24:24.111 --> 24:25.591
Don't be angry.

24:52.791 --> 24:54.391
I came today

24:54.391 --> 24:56.712
to offer a path to wealth to the Huxiao Gang.

24:58.111 --> 24:59.111
What do you mean?

24:59.912 --> 25:03.391
What you sell is merely a crude mixture
of Wushi Powder.

25:03.391 --> 25:04.551
Its properties are mixed and impure.

25:05.232 --> 25:07.432
It takes seven consecutive days
to make users addicted.

25:07.432 --> 25:08.631
Repeat customers are few.

25:09.712 --> 25:11.351
You're only earning petty profits.

25:13.232 --> 25:14.232
Who exactly are you?

25:20.272 --> 25:22.151
I am the one who brings you a great fortune.

25:23.391 --> 25:24.952
This is the Eternity Pill.

25:24.952 --> 25:28.032
Just one lick, and users will get addicted.

25:28.032 --> 25:29.391
Just one pill,

25:29.391 --> 25:33.472
from noble men to beggars,
no one can resist it.

25:33.472 --> 25:37.071
At that time, enormous wealth will be yours.

25:38.071 --> 25:41.032
Since you have such a powerful thing,

25:41.032 --> 25:42.912
why do you still need us?

25:42.912 --> 25:46.272
The ingredients for the Eternity Pill
are sourced from remote border regions.

25:47.111 --> 25:49.192
I have 12 poison makers under my command.

25:49.192 --> 25:50.472
They're all skilled in refining.

25:51.351 --> 25:53.351
Though the Eternity Pill can be made,

25:53.351 --> 25:56.672
to spread it across the Ning Empire,
we have to rely on the Huxiao Gang.

25:57.432 --> 25:59.672
This is a win-win deal.

26:16.111 --> 26:19.032
What exactly are you up to?

26:20.151 --> 26:21.472
Everyone in this world

26:22.551 --> 26:23.591
cares about profits.

26:24.311 --> 26:27.831
We all desire a great fortune.

26:29.512 --> 26:31.151
Take this Eternity Pill.

26:32.551 --> 26:33.912
You'll know once you try it.

26:38.111 --> 26:39.992
<i>Three days later, at the hour of Zi,</i>

26:39.992 --> 26:41.672
<i>have your gang leader come to this place.</i>

26:42.591 --> 26:44.631
<i>Mr. Shangguan will talk
with him about the great cause.</i>

26:52.576 --> 26:56.275
[Wanxiang Pavilion]

27:06.551 --> 27:08.351
Pavilion Master Liu, please show mercy!

27:08.351 --> 27:10.272
My husband must have been drunk,

27:10.272 --> 27:11.952
which is why he sold me.

27:12.631 --> 27:15.472
Pavilion Master Liu,
I know you treat us very well,

27:16.272 --> 27:19.311
but I don't want my daughter to follow suit.

27:19.311 --> 27:20.311
Why are you crying?

27:21.472 --> 27:23.831
Wanxiang Pavilion is not the underworld.

27:23.831 --> 27:25.351
The door is over there.

27:25.351 --> 27:26.351
Anyone who wants to leave

27:27.912 --> 27:29.151
gets out now.

27:29.151 --> 27:31.432
Go in!

27:32.472 --> 27:33.472
Pavilion Master Liu.

27:34.752 --> 27:36.591
This wretched girl intended to run away!

27:36.591 --> 27:38.071
I've brought her back.

27:38.992 --> 27:41.232
One girl for one pill.

27:41.232 --> 27:43.232
I know the rules.

28:04.871 --> 28:06.472
Thank you.

28:06.472 --> 28:07.472
Thank you.

28:11.672 --> 28:13.912
Father, I want to go home.

28:13.912 --> 28:14.912
Go away!

28:23.151 --> 28:24.151
Pavilion Master Liu.

28:24.871 --> 28:27.232
Let me go home, please!

28:27.232 --> 28:28.672
I want to go home.

28:30.752 --> 28:33.151
How many times has your father sold you now?

28:38.071 --> 28:39.071
Wake up!

28:41.512 --> 28:43.712
But I don't want to sell myself.

28:43.712 --> 28:44.712
Selling yourself?

28:46.071 --> 28:48.032
That is the most despicable.

28:48.032 --> 28:52.351
Xiang Ning, tell them why you don't leave.

28:56.032 --> 28:58.952
In Wanxiang Pavilion, I never please men.

28:59.591 --> 29:02.071
Instead, I let men please me.

29:02.071 --> 29:04.791
What I learned are the skills
to make those gentlemen bow to me.

29:05.472 --> 29:09.351
Even the scholars treat me with respect.

29:16.912 --> 29:19.432
You've been with me for so many years.
Don't you know about me yet?

29:20.752 --> 29:22.992
I love children.

29:23.871 --> 29:26.391
Tomorrow I will hire a teacher
for your daughter.

29:27.351 --> 29:28.952
She will be educated.

29:28.952 --> 29:30.311
Hurry, kowtow to Pavilion Master Liu.

29:30.992 --> 29:32.232
Thank you.

29:32.232 --> 29:33.232
Thank you.

29:33.952 --> 29:34.952
Remember,

29:35.712 --> 29:37.512
once you enter my pavilion,
you are my sisters.

29:38.151 --> 29:41.391
When you leave my pavilion,
you will be above others.

29:41.391 --> 29:43.311
Do you know

29:43.311 --> 29:45.752
why these officials tolerate our pavilion?

29:47.272 --> 29:48.272
Xiang Ning.

29:54.672 --> 29:55.992
That's because I have leverage

29:58.071 --> 29:59.151
over them.

30:01.071 --> 30:03.591
Do you want to be ants
trampled to death by others,

30:04.952 --> 30:06.912
or do you want to be glorious phoenixes?

30:08.551 --> 30:09.551
Make your choice.

30:20.432 --> 30:22.432
Pavilion Master Liu, I want to stay.

30:23.512 --> 30:25.512
I also want to stay.

30:28.952 --> 30:30.071
We want to stay too.

30:31.232 --> 30:33.536
I'll stay too.

30:33.536 --> 30:35.631
Now you're my good sisters.

30:36.712 --> 30:39.272
Xiang Ning, take them to the training room.

31:07.272 --> 31:08.672
You can't wait, can you?

31:26.032 --> 31:27.151
Strangely,

31:28.111 --> 31:30.032
the Huxiao Gang has recently been quiet.

31:30.752 --> 31:32.672
We got no news about it at all.

31:32.672 --> 31:34.111
Could it be
that they've caught wind of something?

31:34.111 --> 31:35.351
I think

31:35.351 --> 31:38.272
they must be up to something big.

31:38.272 --> 31:40.712
Miss Meng, have something to eat.

31:42.432 --> 31:44.272
The elimination of the Huxiao Gang
cannot be delayed any longer.

31:44.272 --> 31:46.391
Zhi Li, you are good at deduction.

31:48.351 --> 31:51.311
Can you try
to sketch a portrait of Ling Yun Fei?

31:52.551 --> 31:53.992
That does sound interesting.

31:53.992 --> 31:55.752
Although no one has seen his true face,

31:55.752 --> 31:57.272
we can gather information.

31:57.272 --> 31:58.311
Let me give it a try.

31:58.311 --> 31:59.432
We'll set out right away

31:59.432 --> 32:01.272
and split up
to search for any trace of Ling Yun Fei.

32:04.864 --> 32:06.112
[Ling Yun Fei]

32:20.000 --> 32:22.656
[Fortune teller]

32:28.712 --> 32:31.391
The gang leader of the Huxiao Gang
forcibly seized 13 women.

32:32.151 --> 32:34.032
He looted the Sun family's caravan.

32:34.032 --> 32:35.391
Where did you hear all this?

32:35.391 --> 32:38.071
Miss Shen, I made it all up.

32:38.071 --> 32:39.551
How would I have ever seen their gang leader?

32:39.551 --> 32:40.791
It clearly says so.

32:40.791 --> 32:41.791
It's all fake.

32:51.232 --> 32:54.232
I didn't expect someone
to be so uncooperative.

32:54.232 --> 32:56.351
I have heard a secret story.

33:08.791 --> 33:09.791
It's him!

33:16.736 --> 33:20.544
[Reward: 10,000 Taels of Gold]

33:21.272 --> 33:24.071
If you want to eliminate her,
why not just tie her up and drown her?

33:24.071 --> 33:26.871
Like how we dealt with Censor Zhou
the year before last.

33:26.871 --> 33:28.232
It was quite efficient.

33:28.232 --> 33:30.631
Killing her would only grant her a good name.

33:31.831 --> 33:35.791
To destroy her,
we must drag her into the mire

33:35.791 --> 33:37.151
and ruin her reputation completely.

33:38.351 --> 33:41.831
You used the same despicable means
to tame your wife back then.

33:41.831 --> 33:43.111
Shut up!

33:43.111 --> 33:45.432
When it comes to being despicable,
who can compare to you?

33:45.432 --> 33:49.151
You're infatuated with a prostitute
who's old enough to be your mother.

34:01.071 --> 34:03.631
If it weren't for her saving me
from a desperate situation back then,

34:04.432 --> 34:06.231
I would have died long ago.

34:06.952 --> 34:08.352
And you wouldn't be who you are today.

34:11.032 --> 34:12.631
If you insult her again,

34:13.711 --> 34:16.151
I'll tie you up
and hand you over to Meng Ting Hui.

34:17.472 --> 34:18.711
We'll die together then.

34:21.711 --> 34:22.912
Do you hear me?

34:23.992 --> 34:24.992
Brother.

34:33.512 --> 34:34.512
Fine.

34:35.312 --> 34:36.751
What a devoted lover.

34:36.751 --> 34:39.432
Since you are unwilling to act,
then hide your tracks well.

34:40.231 --> 34:42.392
I will deal with Meng Ting Hui.

34:44.591 --> 34:47.792
You're best at despicable tricks.

34:48.671 --> 34:50.551
I'm curious
to see how despicable you can be this time.

34:52.111 --> 34:53.312
I'll be watching.

35:09.432 --> 35:12.151
Master, we have arrived.

35:16.111 --> 35:17.751
Master Ling, you are quite punctual.

35:19.792 --> 35:24.231
I presume
you've seen the wonder of the Eternity Pill.

35:24.231 --> 35:26.631
But what I want is a long-term business.

35:26.631 --> 35:28.792
That user was dead in less than a day.

35:28.792 --> 35:31.512
Are you expecting me
to collect the debt in the underworld?

35:31.512 --> 35:32.591
The dosage can be adjusted.

35:33.352 --> 35:35.671
As long as I slightly changed the formula,

35:35.671 --> 35:39.191
the pill will make users suffer
and drive them mad.

35:39.952 --> 35:42.432
You made a bold move first
and then revealed your card.

35:43.512 --> 35:47.792
Mr. Shangguan,
you're quite good at negotiation.

35:47.792 --> 35:51.032
However, can you guarantee a steady supply

35:52.432 --> 35:55.071
of these irresistible pills?

35:55.071 --> 35:57.091
I've selected Wangxian Valley
in the outskirts of the capital

35:57.091 --> 36:00.231
to grow the raw ingredient
of the Eternity Pill, Fuqing herb.

36:01.071 --> 36:03.231
The mountain forest is dense,
known to no one.

36:03.231 --> 36:06.872
Master Ling, just nod,
and our deal will be made.

36:08.191 --> 36:10.952
Mr. Shangguan, you've thought it through.

36:12.912 --> 36:15.671
How do you plan to divide the profits?

36:17.832 --> 36:18.832
I want 60 percent.

36:20.631 --> 36:23.111
After all, before they die,

36:23.792 --> 36:26.071
those addicts will reveal the name
of my Huxiao Gang.

36:27.551 --> 36:29.671
Fine. There's plenty of time ahead.

36:30.352 --> 36:32.751
Once the Eternity Pill spreads
throughout the Ning Empire,

36:32.751 --> 36:35.551
you'll be willing to concede small profits.

36:35.551 --> 36:36.551
Quite straightforward.

36:37.231 --> 36:38.432
But since we are cooperating,

36:39.711 --> 36:41.551
why not show your true face?

36:42.432 --> 36:44.392
You wish to see my true face,

36:45.952 --> 36:47.432
but I'm afraid
you'll have to trade your life for it.

36:59.111 --> 37:00.952
<i>Once the whistle sounds, followers come.</i>

37:01.912 --> 37:03.071
<i>Blow this whistle,</i>

37:03.751 --> 37:06.631
<i>and users of Eternity Pill will listen to you
like puppets.</i>

37:10.952 --> 37:12.191
Master.

37:12.191 --> 37:14.591
They were also quite elusive last time.

37:14.591 --> 37:16.432
I have never seen

37:16.432 --> 37:18.671
anyone more arrogant than you, Master.

37:18.671 --> 37:19.912
If this tiny whistle

37:20.912 --> 37:22.591
can truly control the pill users,

37:22.591 --> 37:24.231
it's a good deal.

37:24.231 --> 37:25.231
By the way, Master,

37:26.071 --> 37:30.111
now the entire capital
is full of your portrait.

37:30.111 --> 37:32.191
[Reward: 10,000 Taels of Gold]

37:32.191 --> 37:33.191
Wanted poster?

37:36.271 --> 37:37.671
It's her again.

37:37.671 --> 37:39.711
Who else could it be but Meng Ting Hui?

37:42.551 --> 37:45.231
But good portrait, by the way.

37:45.231 --> 37:47.231
It bears some resemblance to me,

37:48.551 --> 37:49.671
especially the eyes.

37:50.631 --> 37:51.631
Let them post it.

37:52.551 --> 37:53.551
We'll carry on with our business as usual.

37:55.952 --> 37:59.071
Some court official is more anxious
than we are.

38:10.032 --> 38:12.671
Huang Bo, go prepare a carriage.

38:12.671 --> 38:15.231
I will go out of the palace alone.
You don't need to follow.

38:15.231 --> 38:17.312
How can Your Majesty leave without an escort?

38:17.312 --> 38:18.792
The Shadow Guard must escort you.

38:18.792 --> 38:20.432
I must also go with you.

38:20.432 --> 38:22.271
I am going to see Meng Ting Hui,

38:22.271 --> 38:24.191
not to some dangerous place.

38:24.191 --> 38:25.352
Nothing needs to be arranged.

38:25.352 --> 38:27.832
Your Majesty, have I done something wrong?

38:27.832 --> 38:29.432
Why won't you let me follow you?

38:29.432 --> 38:31.551
Miss Meng certainly won't mind my company.

38:31.551 --> 38:33.071
But I mind.

38:33.071 --> 38:35.671
Shut up, and do what I said.

38:35.671 --> 38:36.711
Yes, Your Majesty.

39:03.952 --> 39:05.832
Again, no need to serve me now.

39:05.832 --> 39:06.832
Leave.

39:30.551 --> 39:31.551
Your Majesty, help!

39:32.191 --> 39:33.191
How dare you!

39:34.151 --> 39:35.472
How dare you trespass here!

39:36.231 --> 39:37.231
How dare you!

40:01.671 --> 40:02.671
He Du!

40:11.512 --> 40:13.071
We're supposed to meet at this hour.

40:14.312 --> 40:15.751
Why hasn't he come yet?
